        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha, tazama, akatokea mtu mume mzee, atoka kazini kwake shambani, wakati wa jioni; mtu huyo alikuwa ni wa ile nchi ya vilima vilima ya Efraimu, naye alikuwa anakaa katika Gibea hali ya ugeni lakini wenyeji wa mahali hapo walikuwa Wabenyamini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye alipovua macho yake, akamwona huyo mtu msafiri katika njia kuu ya mji; huyo mzee akamwuliza, Waenda wapi wewe? Nawe watoka wapi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
