        {
          "text": "Hapo walipokuwa wakifurahisha mioyo yao, tazama, watu wa mji huo, watu mabaradhuli wakaizingira hiyo nyumba pande zote, wakagonga mlango; wakasema na huyo mwenye nyumba, huyo mzee, na kumwambia, Mlete nje mtu yule aliyefika nyumbani kwako, ili tupate kumjua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
