            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PRO.13.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "13:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi ikawa, wote walioliona jambo hilo wakasema, Jambo kama hili halijatendeka wala kuonekana tangu siku hiyo wana wa Israeli walipokwea kutoka katika nchi ya Misri hata leo; haya, lifikirini, fanyeni shauri, mkanene.",
          "type": "text",
